  "body": "There's something special about finding a home that's just the right size. Easy to live in, easy to look after, and perfectly positioned to make the most of coastal living.\r\nWith mesmerising sea views, sun-filled living spaces and virtually no maintenance, this beautifully appointed brand-new home is designed for those who'd rather spend their weekends walking the coastline than working in the garden.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area that flows effortlessly to the outdoor entertaining space. Better still, everyday living is all on the ground floor, making it easy to bring in the shopping, entertain friends or simply head out for a morning stroll.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, three generously proportioned bedrooms provide a peaceful retreat. The master suite is a standout, complete with a spacious walk-in wardrobe, luxurious ensuite and breathtaking sea views to wakeup to each morning.\r\n\r\nJust a short stroll to Winston's Cove and an easy wander to Waiake Beach, you'll love having swimming, paddleboarding, coastal walks and cafes all within easy reach. This is the kind of location where life naturally slows down.\r\n\r\nSet on a freehold 232sqm (approx.) site with a generous 174sqm (approx.) floor area, every detail has been thoughtfully considered and finished to an exceptional standard with quality craftsmanship and premium fittings throughout.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n- Freehold title\r\n- Approximately 174sqm floor area on a 232sqm site\r\n- Three spacious bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\n- Stunning sea views\r\n- Light-filled open-plan living with seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n- Designer kitchen featuring Miele induction cooktop, oven and dishwasher\r\n- Elegant Kohler tapware\r\n- Premium Villeroy & Boch bathroom fittings\r\n- Central air conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n- Internal-access single garage\r\n- Beautifully landscaped, low-maintenance outdoor living\r\n- Easy walk to Waiake Beach, Winston's Cove, coastal reserves and walking tracks\r\n- Zoned for Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College\r\n\r\nWhether you're downsizing, starting a new chapter or simply searching for a lock-up-and-leave lifestyle without compromising on quality, this exceptional coastal home delivers the perfect balance of comfort, convenience and location.\r\n\r\nFor further information and to download the property documents, please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/NZK5",
